    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 6,
    "title": "Put a question inside another sentence",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-embedded-questions-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Put a question inside another sentence",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "After 问 or 不知道, keep an information question in its usual order. For an embedded yes-or-no question, 是不是 can stay inside the clause; do not add a second question-ending 吗.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我问明天是不是有课。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ wèn míngtiān shìbushì yǒu kè 。",
                "meaning": "I ask whether there is class tomorrow.",
                "audio": "0c128146dd002945a2185c89b84eed45ec95cee99cbcbca81818ac3c456ebd67"
              },
              {
                "text": "我不知道老师在哪里。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ bù zhīdào lǎoshī zài nǎlǐ 。",
                "meaning": "I do not know where the teacher is.",
                "audio": "34031e8c593bb2f509614cdfc7ba0d5e42bfba080cf50b0929bc9bbac9e8b38d"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "知道",
                "pinyin": "zhīdào",
                "meaning": "know information",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "e67a7d2511fee7f342c4717093d3bf29ab12e4f9bc6863cf250b8bb7e3e97246"
              },
              {
                "text": "什么",
